VALUES ('SBAC','owner_summary','editorial_analysis','SBA COMMUNICATIONS REIT CORP CLASS gives owners exposure to wireless communications towers, site leasing, development, tenant amendments, and long-term infrastructure contracts. The central question is whether its competitive position and reinvestment can convert demand into durable per-share cash generation after the full cost of capital, execution, and industry risk.','Defines the central ownership lens and its falsifiable operating variables.','SBAC SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0001034054&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides SBA COMMUNICATIONS REIT CORP CLASS''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
