VALUES ('SBAC','opportunity','editorial_analysis','Scarce locations, contractual escalators, development, redevelopment, and demand for specialized infrastructure can support cash-flow growth. For SBA COMMUNICATIONS REIT CORP CLASS, the owner must test whether wireless communications towers, site leasing, development, tenant amendments, and long-term infrastructure contracts can gain profitable share rather than treating addressable-market growth as company value by itself.','States the evidence-led path by which the business could expand value.','SBAC official investor materials','https://ir.sbasite.com/','Use the company''s official results, presentations, webcast replays, prepared remarks, and transcripts when the issuer makes them publicly available.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
