VALUES ('SBAC','thesis_breaker','editorial_analysis','The owner thesis breaks if SBA COMMUNICATIONS REIT CORP CLASS cannot defend its position in wireless communications towers, site leasing, development, tenant amendments, and long-term infrastructure contracts and repeatedly fails to convert reported growth into resilient per-share free cash flow after required investment, balance-sheet obligations, and dilution.','Defines evidence that would invalidate the ownership thesis.','SBAC SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0001034054&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides SBA COMMUNICATIONS REIT CORP CLASS''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
