VALUES ('SBUX','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Brand and traffic can weaken the owner outcome; monitor transactions, value scores, wait times, menu relevance, and competitor share. Labor and execution can weaken the owner outcome; monitor wages, scheduling, union activity, turnover, service, and store complexity. China competition can weaken the owner outcome; monitor price promotion, local brands, store productivity, delivery, and consumer demand. A valuation that assumes flawless execution can fall even when the underlying business remains viable.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','SBUX SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000829224&owner=exclude','STARBUCKS CORP filings provide the audited financial record, business description, material risks, commitments, governance, and current reports.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
