VALUES ('SYK','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Product quality and liability can weaken the owner outcome; monitor recalls, adverse events, warning letters, litigation, and remediation. Hospital budgets and reimbursement can weaken the owner outcome; monitor procedures, staffing, capital spending, coverage, and pricing. Acquisition integration can weaken the owner outcome; monitor purchase price, synergies, debt, retention, and product overlap. A valuation that assumes flawless execution can fall even when the underlying business remains viable.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','SYK SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000310764&owner=exclude','STRYKER CORP filings provide the audited financial record, business description, material risks, commitments, governance, and current reports.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
