VALUES ('SYY','thesis_breaker','editorial_analysis','The owner thesis breaks if SYSCO CORP cannot defend its position in food and non-food distribution to restaurants, healthcare, education, hospitality, and other food-away-from-home customers and repeatedly fails to convert reported growth into resilient per-share free cash flow after required investment, balance-sheet obligations, and dilution.','Defines evidence that would invalidate the ownership thesis.','SYY SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000096021&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides SYSCO CORP''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
