VALUES ('TECH','thesis_breaker','editorial_analysis','The owner thesis breaks if BIO TECHNE CORP cannot defend its position in life-science proteins, antibodies, diagnostics, cell and gene therapy tools, spatial biology, and research consumables and repeatedly fails to convert reported growth into resilient per-share free cash flow after required investment, balance-sheet obligations, and dilution.','Defines evidence that would invalidate the ownership thesis.','TECH SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000842023&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides BIO TECHNE CORP''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
