VALUES ('TSLA','business_model','verified_fact','Model 3, Y, S, X, Cybertruck and commercial vehicles; automotive software and connectivity; vehicle leasing, financing, insurance, service, used vehicles, and charging; Megapack, Powerwall, solar, and related services; and an expanding company-operated Robotaxi service. Optimus remains a development and manufacturing program rather than a material reported revenue line.','Identifies the products, services, and customers that produce revenue.','Tesla Second-Quarter 2026 Form 10-Q','https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1318605/000162828026049270/tsla-20260630.htm','The filing reports Q2 and first-half revenue, segment gross profit, net income, cash flow, capital expenditures, liquidity, Robotaxi and AI investment, regulatory credits, legal matters, related-party transactions, and risk disclosures.','2026-07-22','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
