VALUES ('TSLA','opportunity','editorial_analysis','Tesla can spread software, AI, charging, battery, power-electronics, and manufacturing investment across a large installed fleet and expanding energy base. If autonomy and robotics become safe, permitted, reliable, and economic, the company could add recurring, service-like profit pools to manufacturing revenue.','States the evidence-led path by which the business could expand value.','Tesla Q2 2026 Results','https://ir.tesla.com/press-release/tesla-releases-second-quarter-2026-financial-results','Tesla''s official release links the Q2 update, earnings webcast, and investor-relations archive. Company presentation and forward-looking claims should be reconciled to the Form 10-Q.','2026-08-01','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
