VALUES ('UDR','thesis_breaker','editorial_analysis','The owner thesis breaks if UDR REIT INC cannot defend its position in apartment communities, property operations, development, redevelopment, leasing, and urban and coastal rental markets and repeatedly fails to convert reported growth into resilient per-share free cash flow after required investment, balance-sheet obligations, and dilution.','Defines evidence that would invalidate the ownership thesis.','UDR SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000074208&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides UDR REIT INC''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
