VALUES ('ULTA','thesis_breaker','editorial_analysis','The owner thesis breaks if ULTA BEAUTY INC cannot defend its position in beauty retail, cosmetics, skincare, fragrance, salon services, loyalty, e-commerce, brand partnerships, and store expansion and repeatedly fails to convert reported growth into resilient per-share free cash flow after required investment, balance-sheet obligations, and dilution.','Defines evidence that would invalidate the ownership thesis.','ULTA SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0001403568&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides ULTA BEAUTY INC''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
