VALUES ('VRSN','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Demand for internet-domain registry infrastructure, DNS availability, cybersecurity, and operation of the .com and .net registries can slow, shift, or become less profitable even when the broader market continues to grow. Products can lose relevance as architectures, standards, or customer preferences change. Large customers, distributors, foundries, or partners can alter demand and bargaining power. Accounting earnings can overstate owner economics when working capital, capital spending, acquisitions, stock compensation, debt, leases, or dilution absorb cash.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','VRSN SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0001014473&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides VERISIGN INC''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
