VALUES ('VZ','bull_case','editorial_analysis','Nationwide spectrum, network quality, distribution, and converged wireless-broadband relationships can support retention and cash flow. Fixed wireless, fiber expansion, premium plans, private networks, and cost discipline can stabilize growth. Visible progress in wireless service and broadband can improve the durability and quality of earnings. Disciplined reinvestment and capital allocation can convert operating progress into per-share value.','Preserves the constructive interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','VZ investor relations','https://www.verizon.com/about/investors','Official earnings releases, presentations, events, governance materials, and shareholder information published by the company.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
