VALUES ('VZ','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Wireless competition can weaken the owner outcome; monitor churn, promotions, price, gross additions, and share. Network capital intensity can weaken the owner outcome; monitor capex, spectrum, densification, fixed-wireless capacity, and returns. Leverage and legacy liabilities can weaken the owner outcome; monitor debt, interest, lead-sheathed cable claims, pension, and litigation. A valuation that assumes flawless execution can fall even when the underlying business remains viable.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','VZ SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000732712&owner=exclude','VERIZON COMMUNICATIONS INC filings provide the audited financial record, business description, material risks, commitments, governance, and current reports.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
