VALUES ('WEC','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Demand for regulated electric and natural-gas utilities, generation, transmission interests, distribution, and infrastructure investment can slow, shift, or become less profitable even when the broader market continues to grow. Bills, politics, and customer pressure can delay or reduce recovery. Large generation, grid, and environmental projects can face delays or cost overruns. Accounting earnings can overstate owner economics when working capital, capital spending, acquisitions, stock compensation, debt, leases, or dilution absorb cash.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','WEC SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000783325&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides WEC ENERGY GROUP INC''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
