VALUES ('WSM','bear_case','editorial_analysis','Demand for home furnishings and kitchen brands, e-commerce, direct-to-consumer retail, design services, sourcing, and global franchising can slow, shift, or become less profitable even when the broader market continues to grow. Recession, fashion, value perception, or weaker experiences can reduce traffic and price. Low switching costs, promotion, or disintermediation can pressure margins. Accounting earnings can overstate owner economics when working capital, capital spending, acquisitions, stock compensation, debt, leases, or dilution absorb cash.','Preserves the skeptical interpretation as a sourced, reviewable claim.','WSM SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0000719955&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides WILLIAMS SONOMA INC''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
