VALUES ('ZTS','thesis_breaker','editorial_analysis','The owner thesis breaks if ZOETIS INC CLASS A cannot defend its position in animal-health medicines, vaccines, diagnostics, genetic tests, precision livestock tools, and veterinary practice solutions and repeatedly fails to convert reported growth into resilient per-share free cash flow after required investment, balance-sheet obligations, and dilution.','Defines evidence that would invalidate the ownership thesis.','ZTS SEC filing library','https://www.sec.gov/edgar/browse/?CIK=0001555280&owner=exclude','The issuer record provides ZOETIS INC CLASS A''s filing history, including annual, quarterly, current, proxy, ownership, and registration disclosures.','2026-08-02','published','Founding editorial research',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
